GROWTHBOOST AI — COMPLETE APPLICATION BUILD

Project: GrowthBoostAI.com
Product: GrowthBoost AI Business Services Platform
Initial launch market: Birmingham, United Kingdom
Expansion: UK-wide and international
Build objective: Create a fully functional, secure, scalable, AI-powered business-services platform.

1. First inspect the existing project

Before making changes:

* Inspect all existing source code, files, repositories, integrations and deployment settings.
* Preserve existing working functionality and customer data.
* Do not overwrite or delete existing files without approval.
* Identify the current framework and database.
* If the project is empty, create the application foundation.
* Work on a development branch, not directly on production.
* Do not purchase paid services or activate paid subscriptions without approval.

