3. Customer registration and accounts

Build a complete authentication system with:

* Register using email and password.
* Sign in using Google.
* Email verification.
* Secure password recovery.
* Multi-factor authentication.
* Secure logout.
* Account settings.
* Profile management.
* Session management.
* Account deletion and data export.

Every registered customer must receive their own secure account and personalised dashboard.

Customers must be able to:

* View their personal information.
* View their applications.
* Track application progress.
* Access purchased services.
* Upload and download documents.
* View orders and transactions.
* Communicate with support.
* Manage subscriptions.
* Update their preferences.
* View notifications.
* Manage their business profiles.

One customer can manage multiple businesses, but each business must have separate permissions and records.

Never allow customers to access another customer’s private information.

4. Business services marketplace

Create a searchable marketplace where customers can discover and purchase business services.

Include categories such as:

* Business startup assistance.
* Business planning.
* Company growth services.
* Business marketing.
* Website development.
* Branding and graphic design.
* Business automation.
* AI business tools.
* Business funding preparation.
* Business administration.
